Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses, listed below. The per-file
list (author, source, license) is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

Linked libraries (not bundled):
- craft-libs, https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs, revision
  666c358065261a2816b376fa3bb10538dbf53040. Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the craft-libs
  contributors. Licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. Used as the shared Craft UI/settings/atomic/quit layer.

Optional build input (not linked by default):
- craft-fonts, https://github.com/storytold/craft-fonts. A build made with `CRAFT_FONTS_DIR` set to a
  craft-fonts checkout embeds the fonts listed in that repository's ATTRIBUTION.md and uses them as
  fallback faces. Those fonts are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1); each keeps
  its own licence text next to it in craft-fonts. Without the build option nothing is embedded and
  this product bundles no craft-fonts material.

Continuous integration and releases:
- craft-common-actions, https://github.com/storytold/craft-common-actions. Reusable GitHub Actions
  workflows and composite actions (MIT OR Apache-2.0). Used by CI only; not bundled in the product.

Everything else in this repository is original to SubstanceCraft. No Adobe Substance 3D Painter
code, shaders, profiles, icons or assets are used; SubstanceCraft is a clean-room reimplementation
built from public specifications and observation.
